# Ending phase fixture only: final tier and damage are injected.
# Pipe entry and temporary damage immunity are fixtures; no earned clear.
# Fresh donor startup followed by a labelled pipe-action room fixture.
# The entry prefix precedes the explicitly labelled immunity/ending fixtures.
# All waits are guest-frame counts; early map-labelled dumps may still be intro.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
dump map

# Button sequence dismisses the donor intro; no overworld-map transfer.
press select 2
wait 600
dump donor_map
press y 30
wait 240
dump donor_entry
wait 600
dump donor_idle

press y 30
wait 240
dump castle_entry
wait 600
dump castle_idle

# Diagnostic pipe-action room fixture; not a natural route or course clear.
